					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sophia-light" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(306685); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=306685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608498496" alt="Sophia Light" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=306685)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sophia-light" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(306685); return false;" >Sophia Light</a></span> <span class="odate time_1529799317 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 Jun 2018 00:15</span>
