			<div class="content" id="post-content-3847914">
									

<p>This story set after the events of Voct's excellent work <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/metafiction">Metafiction</a> (which you should read first.) This is <em>not</em> the much-awaited sequel - just my imaginings of what happened after.</p>
<p>It's also been kicking around my draft box for literal years, so I think it's time to push it out of the nest.</p>
<p>Agent Hotaru Morisato has become increasingly inspired by philosophical concerns <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/c-sharp">since her retirement from fieldwork</a>.</p>
<p>The Solid Archive made its first appearance in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/lucky-dinosaur">The Lucky Dinosaur</a>.</p>

							</div>

								
