<p>I felt like this got a little too direct in some places, but then I reminded myself of the title. I think that anything addressing metafiction as a concept is tricky to pull off in general, and this is effective for what it is.</p>
<p>Also, I've been thinking lately that I want to write the Foundation as less horrific in the next coming months, and their 'direct appeal' has reinforced that intention now. Poor folks.</p>

