<p>While I don't like the use of meta references, I feel like this is probably the best they can be. I think having them speak directly to the reader really hurt the story, and I actually quite enjoyed the ending where they decided it didn't matter that much and they were just going to live their lives anyway. I think that's a good message, just be happy while you can if you can.</p>
<p>No vote, I feel to conflicted on it.</p>

